# A reviewer's /revise comment on a written work order: Claude revises the
# work order in the description (with the comments), the original request
# isn't captured again, a 🔁 comment says how each change request was handled,
# and the change request is marked resolved (the already-resolved one isn't
# touched). needs-human is added back for the next review.
TICKET_FIXTURE=tickets/work-order.json
COMMENTS_FIXTURE=comments-revise.json
CLAUDE_FIXTURE=claude/revised.json
MOCK_STATUS="Work Order"
